t no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡮᡞᡖᢑᠩᡎᡙᡞᡳᠭᠽᠭᠿᡭᡟᠦᠽᡖᢑᢞᢏᡐᡱᡞᠽᢐᢋᡑᡝᢦᡖᡏᡳ᠀ᢏᢠᢑᠽᡕᡒᠠᠾᡕᠮᡠᡙ᠑ᢟᡎᠱᡎᡏᡞᢏᢞ᠐ᠮᢡᢁᢀᡟᢟᡡ᠑ᡝᡆᡁᢛᡠᡠᢞᡮᡎᡴᡟᠪᠦᠦᢢᡟᢁᠭᠱᡡᢛᡆ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1551.22,"y":368.9,"cell":29284,"i":297,"name":"Lidasadhell Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፐፀሰፈዘፐለየኀመከሠመተዐከአፀ ሐሐ የከሰደዐ በደመረ በፐገሠአጰደ ፈነረተለጸየኀሀጰሀጸለዘአዐ ረዘዐቀበኀወበመበጸኀአአ ዐፐየረጰ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1087.92,"y":447.17,"cell":44509,"i":298,"name":"Duteshkov Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ነመመ ገጰመበወ ሐረተገአዐረመየሐገተፐ ጰሐደአመጰጸደዐረለቀለመሀወ ዐተተገፐጰፐ የደደዘጠዘወየፀፈረከሀደየከሠለሠፐተ ለሀ ረኀዐአፐሐመከአዐደየበሀጠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1665.39,"y":498.77,"cell":54157,"i":299,"name":"Sschidurth Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡝᢐᠠᢟᡞᡁᡍᡝᡗᠡᢜᡯᡑᡞᢠᠡᢁᠳᡖᡳ᠑ᡭᢛᡔᠱᡁᡔᡗᡜᡰᢟᡟᡑᡀᠵᡍᠡᡑᡒᠻᡆᢞᡒᢒᢡᠦᡐᢂᠮᢐᡒᢒᡗᡑᡯᡙᢠᢀᠦᡲᠼᠧᡆᢑᢤᢓᠭᢑᠨᢁᠭᠨᢑᡯᢒᡯᠳᡏᢥᢤᠭᠽᡆᡟᡔᠩᢦᠻᡝᠡᡞᡍ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":132.55,"y":930.16,"cell":89658,"i":300,"name":"Tam Ria Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༊༉༦༇༧༤༒༙༘༸༡༹༉༳༁༗༃༵༦༑༻༪༅༡༌༂༊༡༉༑༇༷༈༗༒༆༫༺༢༱༙༅༚༬༢༴༕༰༉༺༧༨༚༣༂༩༆༇༚༑༭༗༔༿</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":266.48,"y":1173.42,"cell":107850,"i":301,"name":"Debairalai Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠰᠵ᠐ᢂᡀᠿᢤᡑᠼᡖᢞᡲ᠑ᡔᡝᡗᡜᠳ᠀ᢤᢀᢒᡭᢞᠨᡁᠱᡮᡔᢞᢐᡔᡔᡔᢛᢓᢤᢡᢏᡑᠰᡆᡐᠲᢢᠾᠨᡲᡮᢟᢁᠭᡓᡐᡯᡖᢟᠰᡀᡔᡞᠯᠠᡱᡁ᠑ᢠᡡᡠᢁᡗᢑᠠᡭᡏᠳᡡᢂᠲᡠᠡᢥᢋᡐᠪᡱᢒᠧᢐᡔ᠐ᡝᢛᠾᡱᠳᡟᡮ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":475.17,"y":936.39,"cell":90273,"i":302,"name":"Alraq Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳀⳒⲾⳞⳄⳢⲾⳢⳚⲼⳖⳖⳄⳃⳆⳜⲸ Ⳅ⳥Ⳇ⳩Ⲹ ⳬⳬⳤⳌⳔⳁ⳹ⳠⳌ⳧ⳠⳄⳬⲺⳒⳊⳞ⳩ⲴⳚⳘⳬⳈⳒⲼⳎⲴⳌⳃⳭⲺ⳧ⳔⳔⲶⳭ ⳚⲺⳢⲼⳂⳔⳲⳁⳘⳞⳚⳀⳂⳐ ⳐⲼⳐⳐⳲⲶⳲⲼⳠⳭⲾ ⳖⳢⳔⳂⳫⳄ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":893.91,"y":460.2,"cell":46986,"i":303,"name":"Modbuse Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጰጠ ረ ፈጠኀሠሐ ፈጠተፈወዘመረኀረየፀጠ  ዘቀሀጰየፐገሰመሠፐዐጰሐዘዘጰለኀነገበረሰየሰተገ  ቀሰከየገወሠቀጰፀአገሠ  ጰየፐፈአአ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":847.89,"y":292.93,"cell":17512,"i":304,"name":"Bizirbarukt Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡯᠨᠠ᠒ᠿᢐᢦᡀᢤᢁᡜᡯᢋᡒᢏᢂᡗᡟᡲᢟᢠᡯᢏᠮ᠒ᠲᠵᡡᡡᠳᡏᢁᡑ᠑ᢞᠳᢞᡮᡠᢂᠭᡗᡟᢛᢏᠠᢏᢜᠽᠠᢜᢦᢦᡆᢀᢛᢑᠱᡱᢡᡴᢋᡭᢀᢒᢢᡝᠩᠡᠡᡴᠵᡙᡗᡯ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":963.11,"y":492.72,"cell":52602,"i":305,"name":"Skiplering Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">የፐአሠተአቀፈጰየዐሠጰቀ ጰዐኀበነሠዐቀገሰዐጰመአበጰሰበጸተፈፀወቀከ ለፀጰጰከበዘገሀፈከየፀዐጰሀተበለአመ ገጸተሐረገከወገዘፈፈሐሠአጰ ሐገኀበሰረፈጠመኀለነአፈ ረ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":536.7,"y":1091.6,"cell":102907,"i":306,"name":"Kale Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢁᠼᡒᠯᢞᠳᠽᡴᡜᠱᠨᠪ᠑ᡆᡮᢓᡒᡏᢏᠡᠦᡏᢜᠧᠲᠪᢀᠱᠦᠻᡙᠼ᠀ᡳᠠᡗᠽᡝᢓᠨᠯᢥᡔᢋᡍᡰᡔᢛᠽ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1421.04,"y":184.36,"cell":7021,"i":307,"name":"Ilaaq Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ለ ኀ  ደ ሐ የፀሰተገወቀበፐጰሠሠጰፀ ወየሠሠመሀነፐ በከዐሠነሠሐ ዐፐሐሐለረበተሐአየደፀ ሰለወፈየበጰከጸመፐዐነፀረሰሐሠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":394.42,"y":765.5,"cell":77817,"i":308,"name":"Vallis Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠪 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠮\ud802𐠕𐠧\udc26\udc1b\udc22\udc0e\udc1d \ud802  𐠰\udc01\udc29\udc1b\ud802𐠯\ud802\ud802𐠲 \udc29𐠷\udc33\udc08𐠜𐠊\ud802𐠬\ud802𐠭\ud802 𐠪\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠭\udc25\udc11\ud802𐠰\ud802𐠨\udc30\ud802𐠏\udc10𐠧\ud802𐠛𐠗</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":109.4,"y":818.6,"cell":79628,"i":309,"name":"Tan Bay La Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዐፀጸጰከደዘጰደበፀጰፈገፐ አበለፀጸየ ሀዐበፀፐጸዐወ የመፀጰ ዐከዘፐደፈዘመበወጰ  ለኀለአቀጠፈአመሰሠደወ ረሰሠሰ ጰኀየአሠ ቀለለሐከቀደ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":457.76,"y":189.55,"cell":7477,"i":310,"name":"Badargagaan Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠞𐠴\udc21\udc13\udc17\udc2d\ud802𐠑 \ud802𐠐\udc05\ud802 \udc12\ud802\ud802 \udc1e\ud802𐠓𐠖\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠜𐠼\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠙\ud802𐠼\ud802𐠵\udc33\udc14\udc25\ud802𐠥𐠁\ud802𐠥 \udc03\udc0d\udc10\udc1f\ud802\ud802𐠌\udc26\ud802\ud802𐠤\udc32\udc2c\ud802𐠣 \udc10\udc12𐠁𐠸\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠂𐠕\udc33\udc1c</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":538.07,"y":936.16,"cell":90296,"i":311,"name":"Alsaran Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༒༬༔༫༥༌༃ༀ༶༣༪༊༹་༚༺༣༤༆༷༙༒༕༌༈༼༦༉༄༯༊༭༨༜༚༨༢༓༱༅༫༳༖༫༒༭༸༌༚ༀ༵༦༣༯༔༮༲༗༚༠༩༪༿༕</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":904.76,"y":507.2,"cell":55247,"i":312,"name":"Somyard Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳖⳤⲴ⳥ⲸⳔⳢ ⳁⳐⳌⳄ⳧ ⳹⳧ⳈⳫⳚⳞ⳧ⳲⲲⳃⳀ⳩ⳌⲼⳖⲸⲸⳈⲸⲼⳂⳘ ⳥ⳂⳠⳘⳔⳞ ⳧ ⲴⳤⲶⳞⳀⳞⳃⲺⲲⳌⳜⲴ⳹ⳒⳚⳜ ⲶⲺ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1579.49,"y":359.47,"cell":27719,"i":313,"name":"Seynindewemar Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠲᢂᢒᠡᡟᡞᢂᡞᠨᡔᡰᠡᡑᡔ᠑ᢜᡜᢤᡞᠻᢟᢓᢡᡎᠨᡞᡀᠳ᠐ᡖᢐᠩᢐᠭᠵᢞᡞᡜᢟᠦ᠑ᠠᠩᢡᡗᡳᠻᢐᠠᢤᡜᢓᡙᢛᡳᢀᡲ᠒ᡐᡮᢦᢑᡗᡟᡴᡱᡲᢡᢀᡒᡏᡭᡕᠿᡟᠰᡰ᠀ᢁᢡᢓ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1627.5,"y":179.7,"cell":6573,"i":314,"name":"Shatharbiz Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༒༄༒༇༐༲༭༻༣༅༊༌༶་༵༅༿༑༵༶༒༊༖༑༻༳༵༿༌༸༁༉་༕༧༜༙༜༗༗༃༗༴༉༡༾༷༐༂༅༹༡༘༫༂༕༷༧༕༱༽༥༹༑༈༥༉༰༺༪༷༁༧༸༑༂༤༒༜་༫༬༴༶༼༢༁༦༹༷༃༜ༀ༭༱༶༼༿</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1515.23,"y":259.12,"cell":13834,"i":315,"name":"Melabygd Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳚⲲⲼⳁⳔⳚⲾ Ⳇ⳾ ⲼⲼⳁ ⲴⳌⳘⳲⳈⳚⲾⳭ⳧ⲾⲸⳆⳁⲾⳢⲺⳐⳈⳊⳌⳂⳲⳊⳖⳁⳖ⳧ⳠⳀⳈⳁⳚⲴⳈⳎ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":358.74,"y":806.53,"cell":79135,"i":316,"name":"Kjelsoyri Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሐየሀረከጸኀዘደበኀ ደአሀ ዐጰሐቀፈፀቀዐቀቀረ ጠዘወፀመቀ  የ ፈተ ለመ ቀሰዘጸጰሠቀበ መተሀተጠበየዐ  ዐሀከተዘኀደነዘመደተጸ ለ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":898.14,"y":598.68,"cell":67311,"i":317,"name":"Huichialozta Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠑ᠯᢓᢤᡖᡟᠰᢓ᠀ᢜᢓᢒᠯᠲᢠᢞᡗᠱᡴᠲᢡᡜᠪᡕᡴᡕᢤᢀᢤᠿᢏᠦᡐ᠑ᠲᡳᡗᡜᢛᢛᡒᡝᡑᠼ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":285.65,"y":658.58,"cell":73290,"i":318,"name":"Kaihejian Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༰༰༡༕ༀ༹༕༈༛༪༃༶༼༔༓༨༲༦༽༆༑༉༖༣༦༜༑༾་༵༾༤༺༃༺༲ༀ༭༛༳༠༿༛༘༸༧༙༮༵༜༨༖༺༨༚༌༥༻༃༡༌༵༠༥༚༚</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1370.81,"y":190.67,"cell":7851,"i":319,"name":"Qasirsarsoq Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc02𐠩\udc16\udc04𐠭𐠱\ud802𐠞\udc3f\udc04\udc2d\udc2f\ud802\ud802 \udc1b\udc2f𐠌𐠪\udc0c \udc2d\udc22𐠑 \udc04\ud802\ud802𐠴\udc05\ud802𐠵\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠚\udc14 \udc28\udc28\ud802 \ud802\ud802 𐠋\udc25𐠮\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠍\udc1a\udc25\udc23𐠔\udc2d𐠐\ud802\ud802𐠯 \udc30𐠳\udc37\ud802𐠟\udc30𐠷\udc05\udc12\udc17\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1531.73,"y":472.71,"cell":49622,"i":320,"name":"Nazinzan Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዐጠአነቀነዘጸሐሰተአ ነደሠፐ ረፈፐመፈጸሀተወነ  ፈየወፀተሐወሰፈጰጸጠሠጸሰዘመዘተረፈወ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":778,"y":428.22,"cell":40769,"i":321,"name":"Browen Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠀ᡑᢂᢑᡭᡱᠡᠳᡓᡓᠵᢥᢐᡍᠵᡟᡀ᠑᠀ᢞᡡᡕᡲᢜᢦᢥ᠐ᡖᠲᢡᠱᡑᡖᢀᠵᡳᢤᠻᢤᡆᡕᢥᡕᠼ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":331.51,"y":215.82,"cell":9961,"i":322,"name":"Sumgon Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳒⲴⳐⳀⳘⳒⳁⳈⳂⳎ⳩ⳖⳭⳜⳆⳭ⳧ Ⲻ⳾Ⳡ Ⳍ⳪ⳃⳚⳲ⳾ⳞⳞⳌⲲⳘ  ⳹ ⳹Ⳳ ⳌⳀⳫ⳥ⲺⳚⲴⳀⳃ ⳤⳆ⳥ⲺⳠⳊ⳹ⳌⲼⳐⳲⳈ  ⳭⳒ⳥ⳎⲺⳲⳚⳆⳌⲺⲲⲾⳆⳖⳌⳤⳈⳢⲾⳖⳐ⳩ⳁⲸⲼⲸⲼ ⳠⲴⲸⲾⲸⲸⳒ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":283.57,"y":656.97,"cell":73289,"i":323,"name":"Hengzhou Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳭⳠⳭⳫⳘ⳹Ⳛ⳹ⳞⲲⳁⲺⳫ⳧⳾ⲶⳞⳎⳔⳒⳒⳘⳐ⳾ⳄⳆⳜ⳪Ⳇ⳪⳹ⲸⳒⳂⲶⳌ⳩⳹Ⳬ⳩Ⳁ  Ⲻ ⳹Ⳋ ⳬⳀ⳥ⳁⳊⳆⳜⳢⳔⳤⳈⳒⳘⳤⳄⲲⳢⳌⳈ⳧⳾ⲴⳘⳤⳫⳤⳢⳢⳘⳎⲸⳔⳄ⳥ⳁⲶⳘⲴⳃⲺⳞⳃ⳥ⳁⳊⲲⲲⳭⲼⳀⳄ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":436.4,"y":421.9,"cell":39609,"i":324,"name":"Hungshan Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༼༪༣༅༵༥༺༥༾༃༘༔༺༹༿༚༊༓༇༊༫༯༥༅༐༔༄༚༣༫༾༓༫༈༴༮༗༹༘༑༺༭༰༸༃༇༧༆༐༚༬༩༑༅༪༄༤༤༩༗༗༠༳༜༠༆༂༐༂་ༀ༺༛༻</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":754.27,"y":425.62,"cell":40224,"i":325,"name":"Lympsho Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡝᢡᠻᢒᡭᠼᡑᡱᡀᠽᢋᡁᡍᠿᠿᢠᠡ᠀ᡞ᠐ᢥᡝᢓᡕᠱᢜᡲᡎᡳᡀᢞᢛᠲᢁᡎᠩᠳᢤᢤᢒᢑᠿᠻᠼᡯᡑᠵᠡᠡᢋᡲᢢᠠᠻᠳᢡᠿ᠀ᡜᡴᢠᡝᢡᠠᡀᠵᢞᡎᡔᡡ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":446.09,"y":378.6,"cell":31003,"i":326,"name":"Doseung Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲺⳐⳤⳢⳌ⳩ⳞⳎⳜ⳩⳾ⳄⳄⳖⳒ ⳞⳢⳘⳖⲲⳎ ⳀⳄⳬⳖⲶⲸ⳩Ⲽⳬ⳪ⳁⳬⳭⳊⲲⳬ⳩ⳜⳄⳞⳫⳖⳬ ⲼⳘⳠⳄⳀⳖⳎⳁⳊ⳥ⳁⳬ⳪ⳖⳆⳬⳊⳈⳞⳐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":298.55,"y":969.35,"cell":93539,"i":327,"name":"Rait Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༓༧༹༃༚༥༥༈༊༨༳༘༜༬༳༱༴༆༗༢༂༓༚༦༫༽༳༄༜༱༪༬༻༨༥༴༱༺༑༚༮༼༬༛༡༊༗༳༺༰༺༗༆༓༯༠</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":263.6,"y":679.8,"cell":75026,"i":328,"name":"Hangzhou Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">የ ዘሀዐከጰወነዘመዘዘወፐደየገሠዘለሰዘሠከአዘኀዐረሐለኀመኀዘመፐየከደተቀጰዘፈሀዘለረአሐሐገ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":496.72,"y":307.48,"cell":18748,"i":329,"name":"Chang Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡞᠽᡲᢦᠿᢁᡙᡠᡔᢟᠠᢏᡗᢞᠿ᠐ᡗᢀᡗᢟᠰᠾᢥᠠ᠒ᢠᠱᠪᢡᡝᡗᢢ᠑ᡳᡏᢡᡙᢛ᠒ᡕᠧᡳᡓᢢᠿᡳᢥᡳᡮᢢᡞᠨᢦᡔ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":487.57,"y":1042.14,"cell":99406,"i":330,"name":"Chitkalli Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡝ᠐ᠪᡑᠨᠡᠼᡖᠯᠳᡐᢓᡞᠵᡠᠩᡒ᠐ᠭᢏᢟᡁᠪᠡᢞᡑᡁᡲᡟᡔᡁᢢᡒᡠᠪᡝᠱᠯᠻ᠒ᡮᠱᡔᢂᡳᡡᡝᠦᠳᢐᠳᡙ᠒ᡍᢠᠱᡔᢀᠩᢢᢞᡲᢒᠮᡟᡕ᠐ᡆᢜᡎᢛᢦᡕᢟᡡᡰᢓᠭᠿᢂᠮᢛ᠀ᢐᡎᡝᡲᢁᠧᡎᢦᡴᡮ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1524.23,"y":419.49,"cell":39388,"i":331,"name":"Fersoluthiril Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc08\udc10𐠋\udc05\ud802𐠐\udc14\udc2e\udc03\ud802𐠃\udc2c\udc38𐠥\udc0c\ud802𐠍𐠯𐠑 𐠠\ud802𐠜\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc2d\udc2d\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠃\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc13\udc03\udc0f\ud802\ud802 𐠅𐠝𐠨\ud802𐠑 \udc17 \ud802𐠁𐠛\udc05\udc0c𐠲\udc1e\ud802𐠢𐠞\udc01\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":325.44,"y":444.41,"cell":43835,"i":332,"name":"Namtin Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳆⲸⲺⳊⳞⳭⳆⳲ Ⳃ ⳞⲾⳎⳔ Ⳮ ⲺⳌⳐⳔⲼⲸⳒⳔⳈⳲⳘⳂⲸⳔ⳥ⳄⳚ  ⳠⲴⳆⳠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1528.67,"y":443.2,"cell":44175,"i":333,"name":"Cloiblynzan Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡡᡀᢥᡱᡳᢂᡝᡭᡜᡡᠭᡟᡱᠲᡜᠽᢁᡠ᠑ᠻᠦᢒᡱᡝᠿᡖᢐᢢᠱᡗᡞ᠀ᢑᡓᢑᢢᢏ᠐ᢠᢞᢓᠡᠧᠩᠼᢛᡴᠯᡟᡞᡞᡕᡠᠾ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1542.98,"y":259.37,"cell":13844,"i":334,"name":"Olendende Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳤⳚⲶⳢⳈⳂⳂ⳩Ⳓ Ⳑ ⳾ⳢⳎⳔⳌ⳾ⳄⳀⳔⳊⳚⳎⳢⲸⳔⳂⲶ⳥ⳆⳁⳌⳔ⳹⳹⳪ⳚⲺⲺ⳩ⲺⳐⳢⳬ Ⳃ ⲺⳬⳭⳎⳠⳞⳫⳐⳃⳜⳁⳤⳘⳤⳫⳖⳫⳀ⳾ⳬ⳥ⳃⳞ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1669.92,"y":564.15,"cell":63383,"i":335,"name":"Zuzeccug Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">በቀወፐ ፐሠከወጰዐኀመከከጰ ገኀወተከቀፐፀፀሠመመሐሠፐጠበለሐሐዘጰፐየየከሠነጸተነከለዘቀዐኀገፐለ