༤</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":462.39,"y":192.19,"cell":7765,"i":341,"name":"Khovshiltant Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⲵ⳥Ⳙ  ⳀⲴ ⳈⳤⳘⳖⳀⳁⳒⳘ⳪ⳤⳔ⳧  ⲶⲸ ⳹Ⳮ⳹ⳭⳖⳚⲾⳫⲾ ⳄⳔⳭⲶⳁⲶⳞⲶⲾⳭ ⳃ⳥⳩ⳘⳆⳆⲲ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":102.65,"y":949.56,"cell":91414,"i":342,"name":"Anh Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc17\ud802𐠨\udc33𐠩\ud802\ud802𐠞𐠼\udc13𐠢\udc21\udc25 \udc20𐠑\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠿\ud802𐠁\ud802 \udc13\udc1a\udc10\ud802𐠖𐠋\ud802\ud802𐠙\udc22\udc0a𐠖𐠌\udc28\ud802𐠐\udc15\ud802\ud802𐠄\udc1e\udc2c𐠂𐠎\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠫𐠛\udc04𐠱\ud802𐠏\udc23\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1206,"y":676.2,"cell":74941,"i":343,"name":"Accantano Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">አኀጠሠየየለመፐሀከ ለፐዘኀበ መ  ረየፐደ ዐተነሐፐፐደፐሠሐነሀሠነደመሠደተፀቀአለበነተዐነፀፀጸበነጸኀነመሐገወከሐቀረሠፈዘጸረጠከመጰበሀመነሀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":796.73,"y":482.86,"cell":51227,"i":344,"name":"Oakham Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳠⳬⲴⳐ⳧ⳲⳈⲲⳌ⳾Ⲳ⳪ⳚⳔⳆⳜⲼⳜⲺ⳥ⳆⳘ⳩Ⲽ⳹ⳤ⳥ⲼⳘⳫⲸⳂⳈⲾⳢ Ⳏ ⳾ⲸⳲⳐ⳧Ⳗ⳩⳩ⳖⳫⳄⳔⳊⳄⲼ⳥ⳚⳘⳢⳞ⳪Ⳁ⳪ⲲⲶⲼⳢⳘⳫⳆⳁⳭ⳥ⳘⲴⳀ⳪⳧Ⲳⳤ⳹ⲾⳫⳜ⳹Ⳬ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":211.11,"y":671.43,"cell":74409,"i":345,"name":"Zhaoqing Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༑༉༲༷༁༫༴༸༄༅༤༈༗༕༽༳༥༛༶༔༡༾༡༺༵༥༜༄༈༕༉༨༅༊༢༁༬༭༸༴༲༓༈༜༡༈༓༫༲༪༿༬༯ༀ༴༡༛༷༠ༀ་༫༗༗༽༳༢༃༲</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":862.61,"y":390,"cell":33222,"i":346,"name":"Watbury Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscripti