ame":"Huong Cai Cemetery","note":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":539.66,"y":1004.3,"cell":96835,"i":476,"name":"Khana Crypt","note":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1634.23,"y":551.48,"cell":61568,"i":477,"name":"Gidh Cemetery","note":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1046.7,"y":366.8,"cell":28568,"i":478,"name":"Perevorod Crypt","note":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":347.04,"y":213.77,"cell":9751,"i":479,"name":"Govive Crypt","note":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":547.44,"y":228.73,"cell":11106,"i":480,"name":"Hongseon Necropolis","note":"A foreboding necropolis shrouded in perpetual darkness, where eerie whispers echo through the winding corridors and spectral guardians stand watch over the tombs of long-forgotten souls."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1317.99,"y":186.19,"cell":7264,"i":481,"name":"Sernaarfik Crypt","note":"A towering necropolis adorned wi